{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_bobb_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_bobb_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"谁与同行","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"为感染了矿石病的旧友奔走求助时，埃利西奥意识到：靠一个人的力量，或许能救一个人；想要改善感染者的处境，他还需要同行者。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_bobb_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["埃利西奥","局促的病人","尤里欧","粗心的社工","屋内的女声","娜蒂","？？？","议员助理","主持人","赤心医疗人事专员"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_offce.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"text","text":"面试官小姐，您问我为什么会选择贵司，请容许我与您分享我在街区做社工时，偶尔遇见旧友的一段经历。","id":7},{"type":"dialog","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"下一位，请把体检报告放在这里。您的姓名？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"局促的病人","text":"......尤里欧·布兰科·安东尼奥。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"尤里欧？是你！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"太好了，埃利西奥，你还记得我。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"你说什么呢，中学时代能说上话的朋友本就没几个。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3B/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"那件事后就联系不上你了，我还一直担心。你后来去了哪里，现在怎么样了？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"......呵呵，你说的是，我们被那帮小子堵在学校厕所，然后我把其中一个的鼻子打歪的事。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"后来为了一根活该断掉的鼻梁骨，学校要开除我，你坚持申诉，甚至找了校长，最后他们居然真的把开除降级到了普通处分。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"可你还是选择了离校......","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"原谅我，埃利西奥。我当时认定，我们这些难民的后裔在学校里只有被欺负的份，没有必要死皮赖脸地看他们脸色。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"哈哈......我多傻呀。在学校里，我们至少还有绩点和他们比。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"尤里欧......你现在还好吗？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"我......埃利西奥，说实话，当我们被那些人堵在厕所的时候，你不肯动手，非要和他们讲道理，我在心里是看不起你的。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"但是在知道你为我做了什么以后，我开始佩服你。你看现在，你能在社区里帮忙，而我依旧是那个拖后腿的。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"text","text":"我注意到他手里拿着体检报告。当然，他一进来我就注意到了。","id":42},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"你的病况......已经这么严重了？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"在这里，最严重的疾病是贫穷，比矿石病要可怕，老朋友。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"帮我在上面盖个章吧，我听说赔付的时候要用。你们是保险公司的合作机构，他们承认你们的体检结果，对吗？","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"charslot","id":53},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"我的体检报告......有什么问题吗？","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我很少见到第一次来，病况就如此严重的病人。除非是一些消极治疗或者......很晚才确诊的人。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"你上一次体检是什么时候？在哪里做的？能给我看看报告吗？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"我带了......前几次是在家附近的社区机构体检的。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"这......你的药有按时服用吗？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"这你可不能乱说！我向你保证，药我一顿不落地吃！","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"只不过，不同人吃药的效果也不同，不、不是吗？如果有包治包好的特效药，这世上早没有矿石病了！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"不用看这么仔细吧？体检报告而已，没有问题就帮我盖个章吧。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"可是，你这个季度的体细胞与源石融合率提升了接近1%，才一个季度，再这样下去......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"如果基础药物对你不起作用，其实你需要考虑进一步的治疗方案。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"很有用的建议，我会考虑的。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"尤里欧......是钱的问题吗？","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"......否则呢？支付一份基础保费已经是我家的极限了。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"娜蒂怀孕了。是的，我结婚了，埃利西奥。还没得病的时候，我觉得认识她是我在这见鬼的国家里唯一遇到的好事。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"可现在，我成了这个家的累赘。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我很遗憾......尤里欧。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":90},{"type":"text","text":"我说，我很遗憾。那一刻，我确实相信这是无可奈何的事。来这里的许多病人病情一步步恶化，最终都是这样的结局。","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"埃利西奥，如果你真的想帮忙的话......你这里有没有没人要的药？我是指，多余的，保险公司给你们的样品，或者过期药之类的。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"如果你能顺手给我一两盒......","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"对不起，这我办不到。我们每一份药物的领取都是需要登记的。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"......埃利西奥，我们以前关系那么好的时候，我都没有求过你任何事吧？我、我对那帮哥伦比亚小子都没低过头，我最讨厌求人的。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......对不起，尤里欧。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"好吧！别放心上，跟你开玩笑的。我领了分内的药就会离开。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"尤里欧，请填一下这张表格吧。我们每个月都会尝试在社区里募集资金，帮助经济困难的病人得到免费治疗......","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"有人得到过你说的那种帮助吗？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"有。尽管......很少。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"幸运不会平白无故降临到我们这种人身上的。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"填上吧，尤里欧。我去取你这个季度的药，请稍等。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"储物室门是玻璃的，用工牌刷开门的时候，我从玻璃的反光中，看到他伸着脖子看我。","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"我感到愧疚，或许他还心存希望，我能找到那么一盒多余的药。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"尤里欧......你的药。体检报告上的章我也已经盖好了。你的事我会想想办法的，一定会尽力的。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"不管怎么样，谢谢你，埃利西奥。谢谢......再见。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_bg_bg_warehouse.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"一开始，我并未怀疑这场老同学的相逢有什么深意。直到第二天早上，我的同事心急慌忙地来找我。","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"四十五、四十六......真的少了一盒药。昨天下班前我清点过，数目是正确的。米克，是你提出的再清点一遍药物，发生了什么？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_223","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗心的社工","text":"才少了一盒？其实......我怀疑我们办公室遭了贼。昨天，我的工牌失踪了，今天早上我在走廊上发现了它。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_223.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_223","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗心的社工","text":"......别这样看着我，我知道你提醒过很多次......","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_223.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"把工牌随意放在桌头，进出办事的居民都会经过。等到丢了东西，就不得不怀疑是他们所为。这对双方都不负责。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_223","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗心的社工","text":"好了，好了，你教训的是。那么，你最近有接待什么可疑的人吗？","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_223.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_223","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗心的社工","text":"你看，会不会真的有人来办事的时候偷了工牌，偷了一盒药，然后丢下工牌跑了？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_223.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_223","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"粗心的社工","text":"这样想好像又有点说不通，贼为什么只拿一盒？难道还有其他的解释？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_223.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"先不要毫无根据地怀疑任何人了，保管好工牌吧。丢失的药，我来想办法。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F8/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_u.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":156},{"type":"text","text":"那天下班后，我提着一些日用品，拜访了尤里欧家。","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"我知道我没有证据就不该怀疑他，但他的突然出现，他的病况，还有他的状态都使我无法释怀。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"看到站在门外的是我时，他脸上流露出的神情确实并非欢迎。我想我在他的脸上看见了......敌对，还有一丝害怕。","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"他只肯把门开一小条缝，还用自己的身体挡着那条缝。","id":160},{"type":"dialog","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":163},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":164,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"（压低声音）埃利西奥......？你怎么会......！","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"你的登记资料里写了你的地址。原谅我冒昧前来，我有点放心不下，你和你的夫人还好吗？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"（压低声音）是的......是的，你看到了，我很好。或许我昨天不该来找你搭话......总之，不用为我们操心。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"（压低声音）家里很乱，也没什么像样的吃的，连咖啡渣都泡了好多遍了，就不请你进来了。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"至少，请允许我探望你的夫人......","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"（压低声音）她刚刚查出怀孕，医生说她需要清静地休养。你走吧，埃利西奥。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"屋内的女声","text":"亲爱的，我听到了耳熟的名字，是你那位老同学来了吗？","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"亲爱的，你怎么还下床乱跑？！埃利西奥他......正要离开，我去送送他。不，你不用过来......","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","posfrom":"20,0","posto":"-20,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"你好，埃利西奥，我是娜蒂。我经常听尤里欧说起你，感谢你对我们家的帮助。进来喝杯咖啡吧？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"不......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"那就太感谢了。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"charslot","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"......","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"亲爱的，倒水的事放着我来。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"你才是更应该休息的那个，我可还没虚弱到这个程度。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......请让我自己来。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"text","text":"经过一番“争执”，娜蒂还是拿出了家里仅剩的咖啡，而他们面前的杯子里只有水。这让我难以下咽，但更不想浪费他们的好意。","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"尤里欧总是惦记着你的好，每当在外头有了不愉快，他总会怀念中学那时候呢。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"那时候，他是个会把自己豁出去的人，我也受了他不少照顾的。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"是啊，把自己豁出去......说起这个，我必须要当面感谢你帮了我们家，昨天......","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"咳！昨天，我向埃利西奥提起了我们将有孩子的事，所以他特地来探望我们。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"亲爱的，不要打断我。这么重要的事，我们应该正式一些表达感谢的。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"关于什么？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"药，你给我们的那盒药。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"text","text":"我注意到尤里欧绝望的神情，他祈求地望着我。","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......药。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......小事，不用介意。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"我知道什么是客气话。一盒药对你来说也不会是小事，但确实，我们很需要它。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"孩子还有半年才能出生，我们夫妻都希望孩子能见上父亲一面。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"尤里欧如果积极治疗的话......","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"......时间不早了，埃利西奥，我送你到车站吧。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_bg_29_g8_alley_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"什么叫，一盒药很重要，因为你必须再活半年？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"饶了我吧，埃利西奥......","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"到底发生了什么，尤里欧？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"......","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"（捂脸痛哭）你非要这么逼我吗？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"尤里欧......","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"娜蒂她......也感染了......我们在同一条流水线上工作，是在同一场事故里感染的......","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"我们研究了保单，以感染者能挣到的钱来说，付完保费后，就几乎不剩什么了......","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"我的情况更严重，何况她怀着孕，也不能太虚弱。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"我们讨论下来，这是最划算的选择——只买一份保险，药她来吃，这样别人不知道她感染了，她还可以出去找正常的、报酬更高的工作。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"而我......","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......身故金。患者在一年内因矿石病死亡可一次性获赔一笔钱......","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"由母亲服药，确保孩子出生，而自己争取在一年内死亡，好给他们留一笔治病生活的费用，这就是你们的打算。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"可是......再这样下去，我可能撑不过半年。所以，当我听说你正好在附近的社区工作的时候，我动了来找你的念头......","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"病情恶化速度那么快，别人可能不愿意敲章。而且，我也在想，如果你能帮我弄到一盒药，或许我就可以多撑一阵子......","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"可我不想害了你，所以我偷了别人的工牌......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"我把什么都告诉你了，天哪，我真的都说出来了......我做了什么啊......别去告发我，好吗？求你了......","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_offce.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":292},{"type":"text","text":"我当时什么都说不出来。为了新生命的诞生，夫妻两人决定了由谁死去。我还能说，这本是无可奈何的事吗？","id":293},{"type":"text","text":"我选择这份工作，正是为了帮助他这样的人——可说到底，我能做什么？只是为他补上一份药？","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"在挫败感中挣扎思考了几天后，我做了一个决定，征得了尤里欧的同意后，开始四处为他奔走。","id":295},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"致塔山科技商务部的邮件，未读。","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"致斯科特议员的邮件，已读，未回复。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"致记者罗兰的邮件，已读，表示十分遗憾，但暗示此类情况并没有新闻价值。","id":301},{"type":"text","text":"致《特里蒙日报》的邮件，已读，谢绝。","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"每一天打开邮箱，收到的都是失望。在发出几十封邮件，奔走十几家机构后，我终于收到了梅兰德基金会的回应。","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"尤里欧的故事得以在慈善相关的刊物里占了车票大小的一块面积。那之后，事情迎来了转机。","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phonevibration","volume":"0.6","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"all","id":311},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","switch":"true","style":"0","offset":"-250,0","channel":"3","id":312},{"type":"3","channel":"3","switch":"false","slot":"m","pfrom":"-250,0","pto":"-250,0","name":"avg_npc_222","duration":"0","id":313},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"none","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"埃利西奥先生吗？您好，我是斯科特先生的助理。斯科特先生读到了您的文章，十分关心您朋友的病情，想要对他进行资助。","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"您好......您是说，那位议员先生？我想，我之前向他写过求助邮件的。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"none","id":320},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"呵......斯科特先生的邮箱每天都被各种请求占满，如果没有及时回复，还请谅解。现在我们将向着同一个目标努力，就结果而言是好的。","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":323},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"（长长舒一口气）是的，请问，需要我做什么？","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"none","id":326},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"您不用再做什么了。这边希望您提供对方的联系方式，剩下的，我们将和那边直接对接。","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":329},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我可以了解，斯科特先生将怎样提供帮助吗？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#4$1","focus":"none","id":332},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"true","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"综艺节目。斯科特先生，将在电视综艺上宣布他的救助计划。","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","switch":"false","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"dialog","id":340},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","tsduration":"0","id":341},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F8/Avg_bg_bg_indoor_u.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drone","volume":"0.8","loop":"false","channel":"ph","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fastener","volume":"0.6","delay":"2","id":346},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_button","volume":"0.5","delay":"2.5","id":347},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ph","fadetime":"3","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":353},{"type":"timersticker","x":"935","y":"80","width":"300","size":"45","time":"9999","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"这里，是尤里欧与娜蒂的家。","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"同许多父母辈来自玻利瓦尔的人一样，尤里欧与妻子住在三十年未经修缮的屋子里，日日夜夜，重复着工资低廉的劳动。","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主持人","text":"然而，这一夜却与平时不同。这一夜，随着一声源石锅炉爆炸的巨响，这对年轻夫妇的命运也被改变。","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"（夸张的语调）亲爱的，亲爱的......天哪，你也感染了。没关系，我们互相扶持，总能渡过难关的！","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"咳咳......亲爱的，其实，今天，我本想告诉你一个好消息的......可现在我不知道这个消息是好是坏。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1043_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜蒂","text":"我，怀孕了。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1043_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_523_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尤里欧","text":"......","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_npc_523_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"尤里欧似乎是忘记了台词，愣愣地瞪着娜蒂，许久许久，他突然痛哭起来，娜蒂起先劝了几句，但很快情绪也失了控。","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"他们的哭泣不像预先的安排，镜头及时拉近，对他们哭泣的面容做特写。这些影像将在精心剪辑后分享给全国的观众。","id":368},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":370},{"type":"timerclear","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"charslot","id":374},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_bg_38_g13_trimountlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":378},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$dignified_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":379,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"斯科特议员的办公室外播放着这期综艺节目。病人拖着病躯，将自己曾经历的痛苦在镜头前演绎。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"他们不得不将自己的脆弱与无助展现给所有人，以便他们的恩人在观众面前“从天而降”，向他们施以援手......","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"我不想去评价这一切，他们得到了帮助，我所无法给予的帮助。正因如此，我去到了斯科特议员的办公楼。","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"您说您是埃利......西奥先生？","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"您联系过我，我写了那篇为尤里欧和娜蒂求助的文章。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"啊，是您。您今天来是为了？","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我收看了尤里欧的那一期节目，在节目最后，我听到斯科特先生承诺他将与社区合作，以减轻感染者们的负担。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我正好负责相关的工作，我是为谈合作而来的。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"没问题，这很好......请问您有预约吗？","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我没有。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"那或许，您需要改日再来。很遗憾，斯科特先生今日的行程已经排满了。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_bg_38_g13_trimountlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"埃利西奥先生，您又来了。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我写了邮件预约见面，可是并没有得到回复。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"如我所言，斯科特先生平时较为忙碌，可能不会阅读所有的邮件。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"所以，我写了一份文档，把我观察到的感染者们目前遇到的实际困境总结在了里面，希望您能帮忙转交给斯科特先生。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"没问题，我一定照办。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"请转告他，我在期待着他回复我的邮件。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"我会的，埃利西奥先生。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":422},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":423},{"type":"charslot","id":424},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_bg_38_g13_trimountlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":426},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":427},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"埃利西奥先生，还是您。这几个月您每周都来询问。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我能为他们做的，也只有“坚持”了，可斯科特先生能做的更多。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"我十分同意，我会提醒斯科特先生阅读您整理的文档的。今天他并不在办公室，您还是先请回吧。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"......我会再来的。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_222","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议员助理","text":"......埃利西奥先生，您其实清楚，对吗。一场秀能为他带来很多，可如果继续介入——“那个群体”又能给一位议员带来什么呢？","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_222.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"感谢您的提醒。我想我听明白了......我不会再来了。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":443},{"type":"charslot","id":444},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_38_g2_colombiaoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"您问我为什么选择贵司，以上便是我的陈述。","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赤心医疗人事专员","text":"感谢您的分享，埃利西奥先生。然而，您还是没有回答，您为什么想来赤心医疗。","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赤心医疗人事专员","text":"在我看来，您最后的陈述表明，您已经认清了现实，不会再在一位追求名利的议员身上浪费时间。","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赤心医疗人事专员","text":"那么，为什么转向我们呢？因为当时只有我们回应了您的诉求？","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我的朋友因为一场特殊的秀而得到了援助，但是，我所见的感染者的境况并没有因此而改变。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"全家共用一份药物的病人；为了隐瞒病情发展而血检作假的病人；因为经济压力和周围人的目光，选择结束生命的病人......","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我没有办法为他们每个人准备一场秀，找到一个愿意提供资金的援助人......","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"甚至，我无法得知我的提案是否有效。没有人打开它，便不会有人提出批评或肯定。","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"我来这里，是想寻求合作。","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_487_bobb_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃利西奥","text":"一个人两个人无法改变的事，当更多有着相同目标的人一起努力，结果是否会有不同？我想试一试。","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_487_bobb_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":469},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":470},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":471},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":472},{"type":"character","id":473},{"type":"charslot","id":474},{"type":"image","id":475}],"characters":["埃利西奥","局促的病人","尤里欧","粗心的社工","屋内的女声","娜蒂","？？？","议员助理","主持人","赤心医疗人事专员"]}